    <title>Useful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-23T00:38:17Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-1" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">When a neighbour’s parcel arrives, a quick note through the door can prevent a missed delivery and open a friendly exchange without assuming they’re home.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#494b39bc39d3ff842e1fe35dd3446615b60cc5455e24351dc7f750dbe562d951</id>
    <title>Hopeful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-23T00:38:17Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-2" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In 1930s Brazil, samba schools brought music, costume-making and neighbourhood collaboration together; their creativity grew into the spectacular annual Carnival parades seen today.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#41e08f18054aba4631064344feed7fe76eb693a8114d551b2027535f7e65e063</id>
    <title>Action</title>
    <updated>2026-11-23T00:38:17Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-3" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Pick a book nearby, open to any page and read one sentence aloud; then retell it in your own words as if explaining it to a curious child.</div>
    </content>
